            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Kobayashi",
            "review_text": "Linhbee\n35 contributions\n0\nTo-go place for omakase in HCMC\nSep 2023 • Couples\nMust-try omakase spot in town. The ambiance was zen, music and lighting were so pleasant. The staff was so helpful preparing a cake for my surprise birthday. Love all the fishes choice and the combination/order was magnificent. Mine was 2500, totally happy and satisfied saturday night. Will keep coming back for more dishes from chef Hiroshi.\nRead more\nWritten September 11, 2023",
