            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Kobayashi",
            "review_text": "Miguel P\nBarcelona, Spain433 contributions\n0\nBest sushi in Saigon!\nMar 2020 • Solo\nThe seasoned chef prepares beautiful edo (Tokyo) style sushi. Crafted with elegance and great technique, the sushi is fresh. They prepare two kinds of rice for the nigiris. All fish protein is locally sourced or imported from Japan. Probably the best sushi bar in Saigon. The tamago is to die for. Great sake selection. Pricey, but worth it for sushi connoisseurs.\nRead more\nWritten March 14, 2020",
